   ],
   "source": [
    "print('Entraînement Isolation Forest...')\n",
    "start = time.perf_counter()\n",
    "\n",
    "if_model = IsolationForest(\n",
    "    n_estimators=200,\n",
    "    contamination='auto',    # seuil géré manuellement\n",
    "    max_samples='auto',\n",
    "    random_state=RANDOM_STATE,\n",
    "    n_jobs=-1\n",
    ")\n",
    "if_model.fit(X_train_qt)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'[timer] {time.perf_counter() - start:.2f}s')\n",
    "print(f'Modèle entraîné sur {X_train_qt.shape[0]:,} connexions')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Scores et prédictions\n",
    "\n",
    "`decision_function` retourne des scores bruts sklearn.  \n",
    "Sur UNSW-NB15, les anomalies ont des scores **plus élevés** (vérifié empiriquement).  \n",
    "On normalise entre 0 et 1, puis on applique le seuil."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Anomalies détectées : 45,336 / 82,332 (55.1%)\n",
      "Anomalies réelles   : 45,332 / 82,332 (55.1%)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Scores bruts → normalisés → prédictions\n",
    "scores_raw = if_model.decision_function(X_test_qt)\n",
    "scores_if  = normalize_scores(scores_raw)\n",
    "preds_if   = scores_to_preds(scores_if, CONTAMINATION)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Anomalies détectées : {preds_if.sum():,} / {len(preds_if):,} ({preds_if.mean()*100:.1f}%)')\n",
    "print(f'Anomalies réelles   : {y_test.sum():,} / {len(y_test):,} ({y_test.mean()*100:.1f}%)')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Évaluation"
